{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "label": "Time-Travel-Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Persistence-ID waehlen, auf eine Sequenznummer ziehen, den Zustand von damals plus die Aenderung dieses Events sehen. Events lassen sich immer auflisten und seitenweise lesen \u2014 mit dekodiertem Payload, Tags und, wo vorhanden, Manifest und Schema-Version."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replay_fold_sources", "label": "Woher der Fold kommt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Events zurueck in Zustand zu verwandeln verlangt onEvent, das in der Actor-Klasse lebt und sich nicht aus gespeicherten Daten rekonstruieren laesst. auto-captured borgt es vom laufenden Actor, registered kommt aus DevToolsOptions; eine explizite Registrierung schlaegt Auto-Capture, weil sie eine bewusste Aussage ist. Trifft keines zu, sagt das Panel das und laesst das Event-Log weiterlaufen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_withreplayfolds", "label": "withReplayFolds", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Registriert match/initialState/fold fuer IDs, deren Actor nicht laeuft \u2014 eine abgeschlossene Saga, eine passivierte Entity, ein nachtraeglich untersuchtes Journal. withReplayAutoCapture(false) schaltet das Borgen ganz ab."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replaystate_same_as_recovery", "label": "Derselbe Fold wie im Actor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rekonstruiert wird mit replayState \u2014 exakt der Funktion, die auch die PersistentActor-Recovery aufruft, inklusive Snapshot-Fast-Path und Integritaetspruefungen. Ein Debugger mit leicht anderem Replay duerfte von dem abweichen, was der Actor tatsaechlich recovert. Folge: ein Sprung weit zurueck ist so guenstig wie eine Recovery."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_state_diff_view", "label": "Der Diff", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gezeigt wird die Aenderung zwischen dem gewaehlten Punkt und dem davor, weil \"was hat dieses Event getan\" meist die Frage ist. Feldpfade sind gepunktet, unveraenderte Felder liegen hinter einem Schalter, der volle Zustand ist einen Klick entfernt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_read_only_by_construction", "label": "Read-only, per Konstruktion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nichts in diesem Panel schreibt in ein Journal, einen Snapshot-Store oder einen lebenden Actor: \"Wie sah das aus?\" ist eine Frage, und sie zu beantworten darf die Antwort nicht veraendern."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_limits", "label": "Grenzen und Sicherheit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grosse Werte werden fuer den Transport gekuerzt (und das Panel sagt es) \u2014 ein Debugger darf nicht der Grund sein, aus dem ein System umfaellt; Event-Seiten sind bei 200/2 000 gedeckelt. Das Panel legt rohe persistierte Events offen und ist damit das erste, das man ausserhalb einer Entwicklungsmaschine abschaltet."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replay_fold_sources", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_withreplayfolds", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replay_fold_sources", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_state_diff_view", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replaystate_same_as_recovery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_read_only_by_construction", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_limits", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replaystate_same_as_recovery", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_replay_fold_sources", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_protocol_tap_requests", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_limits", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_overview_panel_toggles", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_time_travel_time_travel_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_overview_devtools_attach", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/time-travel.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}